<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - May 23.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - May 23.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to May 23.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter	    2,178	    48,178     29,521</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  44	     1,092	  636</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	48	     2,321	  783</p>
<p>Total			2,270	    51,582     30,940</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,831</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	  34		 321	  140</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females     400	     4,169	  846</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		 107	   27</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females     248	    11,942	5,465</p>
<p>Total			  248	    12,049	5,492</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com</p>
